# The D.Ai sound theme, "the diamond family" (docs/SOUNDS.md). Sounds drawn by build/scripts/make-sounds.py.
[Sound Theme]
Name=D.Ai
Name[he]=D.Ai
Comment=Crystal sounds from one family: soft, short, never alarming
Comment[he]=צלילי קריסטל ממשפחה אחת: רכים, קצרים, אף פעם לא מבהילים
Directories=stereo
Inherits=freedesktop

[stereo]
OutputProfile=stereo
